      "content": "Here is a draft you can use, sharpening the focus on parental authority and the right of families to control sensitive content:\n\nSubject: Request for Restoring Parental Authority Over Sensitive Curriculum Topics\n\nDear School Board Members,\n\nWhile I appreciate the school's efforts to prepare our children for the world, I write to urge an immediate review of the current curriculum regarding sexuality and gender. Parents hold the moral responsibility to decide when and how specific life topics are introduced to their children, and schools must not bypass these families by implementing content that contradicts their values. Robust safeguards must be enacted to ensure every district adopts a strict opt-in policy where parents can veto any subject matter before it enters the classroom. Rather than taking matters away from the family, the education system must become a clear and respectful partner, deferring to parental judgment on these critical issues.\n\nSincerely,\n\n[Your Name]\n[Your Address]\n[Your Phone Number]\n[Your Email]",
